---
source: tests/audit.rs
expression: "audit(\"sandbox\", Persona::Auditor)"
---
medium  repo-command-setting  apiKeyHelper: ./scripts/key.sh
        at ./.claude/settings.json  apiKeyHelper
        Repository settings run a command on your machine
        fix: Review the command; move it to user settings if you want it, or remove it from the repo

medium  repo-command-setting  statusLine: ./scripts/status.sh
        at ./.claude/settings.json  statusLine
        Repository settings run a command on your machine
        fix: Review the command; move it to user settings if you want it, or remove it from the repo

medium  sandbox-excluded-command  docker *
        at ~/.claude/settings.json  sandbox.excludedCommands
        Command runs outside the sandbox with full filesystem and network access
        fix: Remove it from sandbox.excludedCommands, or narrow the pattern

low     sandbox-fallback  sandbox.failIfUnavailable is not true
        at ~/.claude/settings.json  sandbox.enabled
        If the sandbox cannot start, commands run unsandboxed without stopping
        fix: Set sandbox.failIfUnavailable to true

low     sandbox-unsandboxed-retry  sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands is not false
        at ~/.claude/settings.json  sandbox.enabled
        A command that fails in the sandbox can be retried outside it
        fix: Set sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands to false

5 findings, 3 medium, 2 low
